======== 3. LexicalContextCompressor: relative threshold and cap
  chunk scores: [1.794, 1.075, 0.0, 0.538, 0.542]  best: 1.794
  threshold=0.0: kept chunk indexes [0, 1, 4, 3, 2]
  threshold=0.5: kept chunk indexes [0, 1]
