======== 4. keyword: no overlap fallback = first N chunks across pages (not one per page)
  query='quantum zebra': sources of kept chunks ['http://a', 'http://a', 'http://a']
  query='the of and': sources of kept chunks ['http://a', 'http://a', 'http://a']
  query='': sources of kept chunks ['http://a', 'http://a', 'http://a']

======== 5. select_context paths (keyword mode)
  6 pages, total chars 12624 (>8000 -> filtering)
  keyword result sources in order: ['http://p0', 'http://p1', 'http://p2', 'http://p3', 'http://p3', 'http://p4', 'http://p5']
  KEYWORD constants: 0.5 25
  small fast path (2 pages, <8000 chars) returns all in input order, unfiltered:
    'Source: http://s1\nTitle: S1\nContent: tiny one\n\nSource: http://s2\nTitle: S2\nContent: tiny two battery\n'
  11 tiny pages (>max_results=10, no overlap with query) -> filtered path; chunks returned: 11 (first-N fallback, cap 25)
  zero pages -> ''
  raw_content None page -> 'Source: u\nTitle: t\nContent: \n'
  page without title key -> 'Source: u\nTitle: \nContent: x\n'

======== 6. mode none: every page, but each page cut at MAX_CONTENT_CHARS
  MAX_CONTENT_CHARS=50, none mode; content length returned: 50
  none mode with 15 pages returns 15 pages (no cap)
  keyword mode, same 15 tiny pages returns 15 chunks
  COMPRESSION_THRESHOLD='abc' -> ValueError invalid literal for int() with base 10: 'abc'
  COMPRESSION_THRESHOLD=0 and 2 tiny pages: chunks returned 2 (fast path disabled)
  import with {'KEYWORD_MAX_RESULTS': 'ten'} -> ValueError invalid literal for int() with base 10: 'ten'
  import with {'KEYWORD_RELATIVE_THRESHOLD': 'half'} -> ValueError could not convert string to float: 'half'
  KEYWORD_MAX_RESULTS=2 -> chunks returned 2 ; select_context max_results=10 ignored by keyword path

